{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f8b2d10-4c7e-4b99-8d12-3f9a1c5e7788",
    "name": "Tocaan - Extendable Order & Payment Management API",
    "description": "Complete RESTful API collection for the Laravel 12 Extendable Order & Payment Management System.\n\nIncludes:\n1. **Authentication** (`register`, `login`, `me`, `refresh`, `logout`)\n2. **Orders & Products Management** (`products`, `orders` index with status filter & pagination, `store` with Idempotency-Key using authenticated user token & DB `product_id` + `quantity`, `show`, `update`, `destroy`)\n3. **Payments Management** (`store` using Strategy Pattern for `credit_card`, `credit_card` pending 3DS, and `paypal`, `index`, `orderPayments`)\n4. **Payment Webhooks (All Cases)** — Valid HMAC-SHA256 signature (`credit_card` & `paypal`), Idempotent Duplicate Replay, Failed Charge Webhook, Invalid/Tampered Signature (`401`), Missing Signature Header (`401`), and Unknown Transaction ID (`404`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
